<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακοιμ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακοιμάω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i> (for which it is a constant v.l.), <i>lull to sleep</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φυλακήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hecat.
					33J.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δυσυπνοῦντα τῶν παιδίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					790d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				223d
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κοιμήσαντ</span>
			'), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.34
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Asin.</u>
				6
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸν λύχνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phryn.Com.
					24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					521
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πολεμίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.346c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>go to sleep</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.67.2
			</span></i>; of troublesome questions, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα . . ἀεὶ ἂν κατακοιμισθῶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1121.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sleep through</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φυλακήν</span>
			<i>sleep out</i> one's watch, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.93
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἡμέρας τὸ Χρησιμώτατον
					-κοιμίζουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
